        "headline": "Winter Storm Watch issued June 5 at 12:20PM AKDT until June 8 at 10:00PM AKDT by NWS Fairbanks AK",
        "description": "* WHAT...Moderate to heavy snow and blowing snow possible. Total\nsnow accumulations of 6 to 12 inches possible. Wind gusts up to 30\nmph possible.\n\n* WHERE...Central Brooks Range.\n\n* WHEN...From Saturday evening through Monday evening.\n\n* IMPACTS...Travel could be very difficult. Gusty winds could lead\nto areas of blowing snow which could significantly reduce\nvisibility.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...An unseasonably strong arctic trough will\npass over the North Slope and Brooks Range this weekend into ",
